{"data": [{"author_id": "104995186", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121748414522356124"], "id": "2121748414522356124", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1772872963743793153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121745848992419885", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PFFeeley @bot @grok Fantastic video. Thanks.", "url": "https://x.com/florasabogal/status/2121748414522356124"}, {"author_id": "1459534948864446464", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121748396637827115"], "id": "2121748396637827115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok @bot is the coolest thing ever!!! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 We have been using it for about 3 week and have everything link to its computer. Completely pays for itself and make you a little extra $$ \ud83d\udcb0.Retrieves lost cash,finds deals,handles returned items,clears my spam emails,makes vector files.", "url": "https://x.com/Techdry100/status/2121748396637827115"}, {"author_id": "830171539999952896", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121748378300371175"], "id": "2121748378300371175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121645711809011981", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "My first date in a long time didn't go quite as planned.\n\nSure, she was very attentive, she even seemed to like my Grok Bot.\n\nBut I was prepared for questions about education, finances, hobbies, the usual stuff.\n\nNot about how much RAM I have and if I know anybody at Nvidia. https://t.co/qzZySe4n0z", "url": "https://x.com/darekgusto/status/2121748378300371175"}, {"author_id": "828772820", "cr